Error [E2702]: crypto API misuse
  --> tests/ui/crypto_safe_raw_algorithm.jet:5:34
    |
  5 |     _ :: crypto.seal([], [], [], algorithm: "xchacha20poly1305")
    |                                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `seal` would select a caller-supplied algorithm, which violates the safe envelope requirement that Jet selects the algorithm internally
 Fix: remove the `algorithm:` argument, or use a raw expert primitive inside `@Unsafe` for protocol interop
